## 2. How to work here
- Read `PROJECT_STATE.md` first. It holds the current phase and the single next action.
- Work in small PRs on a lane branch (`<lane-label>/<short-name>`). One concern per PR.
- Every change needs a test that fails without it. Never weaken, skip or delete a test, lint rule or CI step to get green.
- Validation commands: lint `{{VALIDATION_LINT}}`, test `{{VALIDATION_TEST}}`, build `{{VALIDATION_BUILD}}`.

